## CFD Analysis

**Geometry:** cylinder (2D), L=2m × W=0.8m
**Fluid:** air (ν=1.50e-05 m²/s, ρ=1.23 kg/m³)
**Re = 100** → laminar regime
**Solver:** simpleFoam (steady, incompressible)
**Turbulence:** laminar — no turbulence model (laminar)
**Simulation score:** 0.81 (converged=True)
**Notes:** poor residual convergence trend | Re=100 attached laminar flow, no separation.

